  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, the equation of the focal chord is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Since the chord is tangent to the given circle<br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cosec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> Length of the focal chord,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;units<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>&nbsp;The required value,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mn>12